Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:04.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,When government AI can act, who verifies its authority?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:08.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,WAKALA verifies each agent's identity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:12.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,and limits every delegated action to the citizen's specific request.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:17.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,In a separate, deliberately triggered test,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:20.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Insurance Agent asks for another citizen's record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,WAKALA blocks it before any protected data is returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:30.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Behaviour Watch raises an incident. A verified officer contains it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:33.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,and reassigns the task to a standby agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:40.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,The legitimate service continues, unrelated citizens are unaffected,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:42.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,and every completed action is traceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.35,0:00:46.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Attack Lab runs eight attack scenarios.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.89,0:00:50.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Document Shield quarantines hidden document instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:00:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Synthetic benchmarks measure enforcement. Shadow Mode tests policies safely.
